<!--
  CONTRACT SEED / 契约种子 — 不是从 topsun_dimos main 提取的配置。

  已在 topsun_dimos @ a5259958db23c8ea6648544ed138eab19726ce93 (main) 搜索：
    fastdds.xml, FASTRTPS_DEFAULT_PROFILES_FILE, ROS_DOMAIN_ID, rmw_fastrtps,
    docker/navigation/
  结论：main 上均不存在。

  R0 冻结（docs/architecture/ros2-dds-r0-interface-freeze.md）链 A：
    RMW = rmw_fastrtps_cpp
    ROS_DOMAIN_ID = 42
    FASTRTPS_DEFAULT_PROFILES_FILE 指向本文件（由 config/env/chain_a.sh 导出）

  本文件只兑现「把契约落成可引用路径 + 与冻结表对齐的域/QoS 种子」，
  不是现网 XML，也不是自定义 RMW。
  域 ID 以环境变量 ROS_DOMAIN_ID=42 为准（须操作员显式 source helper）。
  中文说明：config/fastdds.zh.md

  Humble Fast-DDS (2.6) XMLPARSER: History QoS 必须写在
  <topic><historyQos>，不能写在 <qos><history>。
  2026-09-10 基线日志：Invalid element ... Name: history → loadXMLFile 失败。
  iter1 只改这个 schema 落点；kind/depth 与冻结表相同。

  iter2 (one knob): default participant UDP socket buffers 2 MiB.
  Linux default ~212 KiB is smaller than a 1 MiB sample; ping-pong is
  bidirectional so send and listen are the same knob. Not a second change.

  iter3 (one knob): default-participant RTPS send-buffer pool sized
  for a 1 MiB fragment burst. Humble Fast-DDS 2.6 default
  preallocated_number=0 (thread-count guess) and dynamic=false
  (block when empty). 1 MiB / ~64 KiB ≈ 16 fragments. Not SHM,
  not a second socket-buffer knob. SHM maxMessageSize probe
  regressed same-host 1 MiB and was not kept.

  iter4 (one knob): keep the iter3 32-buffer slab (that is the 1 MiB
  win) and set dynamic=false. Humble Fast-DDS 2.6.12 get_buffer
  allocates a new RTPSMessageGroup_t on the hot path when the pool
  is empty and dynamic=true. Mid-size same-host Reliable was the
  booked +23–24% tax; a grow is more expensive than a short wait
  if 32 is usually enough. 16 and 0 probes (dynamic still true)
  did not recover mid-size; 0 erased the 1 MiB win. Not SHM, not
  a second socket-buffer knob.

  iter5 (one knob): additive user SHM sized for mid-size, not 1 MiB.
  Humble implicit SHM segment is 512 KiB. A 768 KiB exclusive-SHM
  probe recovered same-host BestEffort 256 KiB (1653 → 1309 µs)
  but erased 1 MiB BestEffort (80/80 → 1/80). UDP-only (no SHM)
  left BestEffort 256 KiB flat and erased 1 MiB (0/90). Discarded.
  This knob keeps builtin UDP+SHM (iter2 sockets still apply) and
  adds one SHM transport with maxMessageSize 280000 (100/256 KiB
  as one message) and segment_size 2 MiB. 1 MiB stays fragmented
  (sample > 280000) on the builtin path. Not the discarded iter3
  unfragmented 1 MiB SHM probe (maxMessageSize 2 MiB / 4 MiB
  segment). send_buffers 32 / dynamic=false stay.

  iter6 probe (not kept): shm_midsize port_queue_capacity 512 → 64.
  Step A nailed 64 B / 200 Hz first. Gate is jitter, not p50:
  same-host BestEffort RTT p95 1205 → 1234 µs (+2.4%) and arrival
  |I−5 ms| p95 488 → 568 µs. Exclusive / oversized SHM stays
  discarded. 1 MiB gains stay (no landed XML change vs iter5).
  Landed XML is still the iter5 seed (280000 / 2 MiB, builtin on,
  sockets, send_buffers 32 / dynamic=false).

  iter7 (one knob, kept): shm_midsize healthy_check_timeout_ms
  1000 → 10000. Humble Fast-DDS 2.6 default is 1000 ms. The SHM
  port watcher takes empty_cv_mutex when that timeout elapses;
  port_wait_timeout is healthy_check_timeout_ms/3 (idle wait).
  IMU 64 B / 200 Hz is one-in-flight (~2 s per case). Gate is
  jitter: same-host BestEffort RTT p95 1205 → 1148 µs (−4.8%)
  and arrival |I−5 ms| p95 488 → 375 µs. Not port_queue_capacity
  (discarded). Not a second mid-size / socket / send_buffers
  change. 1 MiB stays on the builtin fragment path (sample >
  280000); same-host 1 MiB spot stayed at iter5. Exclusive /
  oversized SHM stays discarded.
-->
<profiles xmlns="http://www.eprosima.com">
    <transport_descriptors>
        <transport_descriptor>
            <transport_id>shm_midsize</transport_id>
            <type>SHM</type>
            <maxMessageSize>280000</maxMessageSize>
            <segment_size>2097152</segment_size>
            <healthy_check_timeout_ms>10000</healthy_check_timeout_ms>
        </transport_descriptor>
    </transport_descriptors>

    <participant profile_name="ros2_hzj_chain_a_contract_seed" is_default_profile="true">
        <domainId>42</domainId>
        <rtps>
            <name>ros2_hzj_chain_a_contract_seed</name>
            <sendSocketBufferSize>2097152</sendSocketBufferSize>
            <listenSocketBufferSize>2097152</listenSocketBufferSize>
            <userTransports>
                <transport_id>shm_midsize</transport_id>
            </userTransports>
            <useBuiltinTransports>true</useBuiltinTransports>
            <allocation>
                <send_buffers>
                    <preallocated_number>32</preallocated_number>
                    <dynamic>false</dynamic>
                </send_buffers>
            </allocation>
        </rtps>
    </participant>

    <!-- Named data_writer / data_reader blocks without is_default_profile and
         without profile_name bound to the ROS topic (ns + name, e.g. /goal_pose)
         are inert: rmw_fastrtps never applies them. Topic QoS stays in the R0
         freeze table. If a writer/reader profile is added later, Humble
         Fast-DDS 2.6 still requires History under <topic><historyQos>.
         /joy: freeze names the topic only. Go2 ROS names: config/topics.yaml. -->
</profiles>
